eue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">YouTube将于2026年5月上线AI自动检测系统，强制标注拟真视频</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI扩大广告平台访问权限，向更多广告主开放免费版ChatGPT投放</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Meta推出Meta One订阅生态并全球扩张AI与专业版增值服务</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">软银携手微软构建AI全自动呼叫中心，推动智能客服转型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/98f27cdad6fc62a82be27665e9437c8c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">软银（SoftBank Corp.）宣布与微软达成战略合作，通过集成Microsoft Azure AI全栈技术，共同打造下一代智能客服平台，旨在解决日本呼叫中心行业劳动力短缺与成本高企的难题。该系统基于Azure OpenAI服务、Azure App Service及Azure AI Foundry模型栈构建，分为人机协作与全自动化两个阶段。目前，AI已作为“副驾驶”优化工作流，未来将通过Agentic AI实现复杂业务流程的端到端自主处理。该平台深度集成CRM与内部业务数据，支持高并发语音与文本交互。软银计划将此解决方案商业化，向行业输出标准化产品，推动呼叫中心从成本中心向高生产力的智能交互枢纽转型，为全球电信与服务行业提供规模化落地的技术参考模版。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达发布开源AI框架Polar，助力Codex等智能体接入GRPO训练</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/7eaa8438d9c6f2649b885a334d0599e2.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英伟达研究团队正式发布开源AI框架Polar，旨在为Codex、Claude Code及Qwen Code等现有智能体框架引入广义相对策略优化（GRPO）训练方法。Polar通过在模型API边界处部署智能体，在不改变原有工具调用、上下文组织及补丁提交逻辑的前提下，实现对复杂长流程任务的强化学习训练。该框架集成了任务提交、会话调度及状态持久化功能，显著提升了训练效率与GPU利用率。实验数据显示，Polar框架在SWE-Bench Verified测试中表现优异，Codex的pass@1分数从3.8%提升至26.4%，增幅达594.74%，且训练时间缩短约5.39倍。Polar的推出解决了传统强化学习环境接口难以适配复杂智能体框架的难题，为代码智能体在多步决策任务中的性能优化提供了高效的系统架构支持。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">YouTube将于2026年5月上线AI自动检测系统，强制标注拟真视频</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/08eac0f1abaedb86a502217de7ca7128.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">YouTube宣布自2026年5月起全面升级AI内容标签系统，由依赖创作者自觉申报转向平台主动识别。针对Gemini Omni等多模态大模型生成的“显著拟真AI”视频，YouTube将通过内部技术系统自动进行识别与标注，以应对生成式AI带来的内容合规与透明度挑战。此次更新后，AI标签的展示位置将显著优化：长视频标签将固定悬挂在播放器正下方，短视频标签则直接叠加在画面上。官方明确表示，该标签系统仅用于提升信息透明度，不会影响视频的推荐算法权重，也不会削弱创作者的广告收益。此举标志着YouTube在应对AI伪造内容方面，从被动监管转向主动治理，旨在平衡平台生态透明度与创作者权益。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI扩大广告平台访问权限，向更多广告主开放免费版ChatGPT投放</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/730c66fd8008a8495148a3d15a35b002.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI正式扩大广告平台访问权限，向更多广告主发出邀请，允许其针对美国、加拿大、澳大利亚和新西兰的免费版ChatGPT用户进行精准投放。该平台已从早期封闭测试转向自助服务模式，广告主可通过ads.openai.com注册，最低每日预算设定为25美元，建议CPC约为3.5美元。OpenAI强调，广告内容将与AI回答严格分离，且不会共享用户个人对话数据，旨在通过高意图的对话上下文实现商业变现。此举是OpenAI实现2026年25亿美元广告收入目标的关键举措，通过集成Criteo等技术伙伴，为消费电子、零售等领域提供差异化流量池。用户可通过升级订阅移除广告，确保在维持免费访问的同时平衡商业可持续性与用户体验。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Meta推出Meta One订阅生态并全球扩张AI与专业版增值服务</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/389552366f83b75ea62f8fb7e39a333d.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Meta正式宣布在全球推进订阅制业务，推出“Meta One”品牌作为统一入口，旨在实现营收多元化。消费者端推出Instagram、Facebook（各3.99美元/月）及WhatsApp（2.99美元/月）的“Plus”套餐，提供个性化社交功能。AI服务方面，Meta One Plus（7.99美元/月）与Premium（19.99美元/月）提供阶梯式算力，支持复杂逻辑推理及多模态生成。针对创作者与企业，Meta One Essential（14.99美元/月）与Advanced（49.99美元/月）提供认证、流量倾斜及深度数据分析工具。Meta计划下月在新加坡等地测试AI订阅，商业进阶方案已在沙特、泰国等地落地。此举旨在通过付费增长服务摆脱广告依赖，并对冲AI算力成本，通过算法倾斜与经营闭环提升ARPU值。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
